The C sources are compiled into the desktop client by tauri/src-tauri/build.rs and provide the
noise suppression applied to incoming audio. Some functions are renamed at compile time
(rnn_* prefix) so they do not collide with the identically named symbols in libopus.

tauri/src-tauri/rnnoise/stb_fft.h is a single-file FFT implementation carrying its own author
credit (ZhiHan Gao) and licence header; see the file itself.

